<!--
  Strings for the app shell: navigation, the design system, and every screen
  except chat (whose strings live in strings_chat.xml).

  Nothing user-visible is written inline in a composable. Beyond translation,
  that is what makes the copy reviewable as copy — the wording of a network
  policy or a discovery caveat is a product decision, and it should be readable
  without opening five Kotlin files.
-->
